35	     * Returns the membership points for an owner. Starts at 0, gains 2 when an
36	     * email is present (non-blank), gains 1 when the owner's name was unique on
37	     * create ({@code namesakeCount} is 0), gains 2 when the owner belongs to a
38	     * household of three or more members and gains 3 for tenure over 365 days.
